  <name>Linamp</name>
  <summary>Winamp-style skinnable audio player</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Linamp is an audio player in the style of the classic Winamp 2: main
      window, equalizer and playlist editor that dock together, with
      support for classic .wsz skins.
    </p>
    <p>
      It plays MP3, Ogg Vorbis, FLAC, WAV, AIFF, AAC/M4A and internet
      radio streams.
    </p>
  </description>
